The previous refactoring was based on principles such as:

Single Responsibility Principle (SRP): Each method or class has one responsibility.

Open/Closed Principle (OCP): The system is open for expansion but closed for modifications.

Strategy Pattern (potential): The division of computation logic into methods or classes.

